Room: the file chooser of a Room page goes to the host.

Chrome runs <input type=file> through FileSelectHelper, which opens its own
ui::SelectFileDialog panel. Room shows its open panel as a sheet on the
page's window with the page's accept types (the Engine protocol's
runFileChooser, Phase 2.6a) and hands the chosen files to the page's
FileSelectListener.

No existing hook: RunFileChooser is a WebContentsDelegate member, and the
tab's delegate is Chrome's BrowserWebContentsDelegate (patch 0015's file); a
delegate wrapping it would have to forward ~150 members; FileSelectHelper's
dialog factory is process-wide. //room takes the chooser only for pages it
wraps whose delegate runs choosers; every other page keeps
FileSelectHelper. Directory enumeration for a dropped folder
(EnumerateDirectory) stays Chrome's.

Phase 3.4a, 2026-10-05. //room: room/core/room_page_prompts.mm.
diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/browser_web_contents_delegate/browser_web_contents_delegate.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/browser_web_contents_delegate/browser_web_contents_delegate.cc
index c29af590a7f1b..24ffad6641b45 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/browser_web_contents_delegate/browser_web_contents_delegate.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/browser_web_contents_delegate/browser_web_contents_delegate.cc
@@ -126,6 +126,12 @@ namespace room {
 // Room: set by //room/core at startup. Takes the hovered link of pages in a
 // Room window (the host's status pill) and returns true; false otherwise.
 bool (*g_update_target_url_hook)(content::WebContents*, const GURL&) = nullptr;
+// Room: set by //room/core at startup. Takes the file chooser of a page in a
+// Room window (the host's open panel) and returns true; false otherwise.
+bool (*g_run_file_chooser_hook)(content::RenderFrameHost*,
+                                scoped_refptr<content::FileSelectListener>&,
+                                const blink::mojom::FileChooserParams&) =
+    nullptr;
 }  // namespace room
 
 namespace {
@@ -1134,6 +1140,10 @@ void BrowserWebContentsDelegate::RunFileChooser(
     content::RenderFrameHost* render_frame_host,
     scoped_refptr<content::FileSelectListener> listener,
     const blink::mojom::FileChooserParams& params) {
+  if (room::g_run_file_chooser_hook &&
+      room::g_run_file_chooser_hook(render_frame_host, listener, params)) {
+    return;
+  }
   FileSelectHelper::RunFileChooser(render_frame_host, std::move(listener),
                                    params);
 }
